5,1,1,talk,Mio,,We really need a system where we don't feel guilty for using the heater. I'll check the winter habits at a house paying ahead and the kitchen notice.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I want to see the actual costs. I'll look at the last twelve utility statements and the electrician's quote for the rooms.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,I'm worried about who does the math! I'll check the monthly settle observed at another house and the trial run of a reconciliation template.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,It's time to see if some of us are carrying others. I'll look at the plug-in monitor readings room by room and sunlight and heating need.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
