55,3,1,talk,Mio,,Option A sounds great because it lets us use the utilities without stress. I vote for Seasonal Fixed Rate.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,Option C is the most cautious. No upfront costs and no complex tracking. I vote for Flat Household Share.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Rin,,"Option C is the easiest to manage. No meters, no complex templates. I vote for Flat Household Share.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Option B is the only truly fair one, but Ryuji is right about the cost. I'll vote Flat Household Share to end the rumors.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Misaki,,I want the least amount of conflict. Flat Household Share is the simplest. I vote for Option C.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Mio,,"@Shunichi, you really think a flat share is fair when some rooms are colder?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,It's fairer than paying for an electrician we can't afford.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,Rin,,It's definitely the fastest way to settle up.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"It's a compromise. It's not perfect, but it's transparent.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"It removes the ""why did the price change"" arguments every month.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,3,talk,Mio,,"I'm still worried about February, but if everyone else wants C, I'll go with it.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
